                                                        <p class="brfprofile">Dr Mohammed Rashid is Phd in Behavioral Finance from Aligarh Muslim University. His research area is finance, accounting, Fintech which includes investigating the psychological and economic factors influencing decision making. He has published papers in ADBC and NAAS Indexing personnel. Moreover Postgraduate in MBA Financial Management and also in Master of Commerce . He is a UGC NET qualified for Commerce 2018 and for Management in 2020. He also holds Certification Course on Financial Modelling and Company Valuation and Advanced excel. He completed B.Com from Aligarh Muslim University. He has attended various national and international conferences and workshops organized by ICSSR and UGC. </p>
